  "question": {
    "text": "Let tangents <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></math> are drawn from the point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mi>S</mi></math> is the focus of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, then the value (in units) of&nbsp;<math><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "22",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math> units"
  }
